<title>UK: Glaxo Wellcome FY profit jumps.</title>
<headline>Glaxo Wellcome FY profit jumps.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to Dec 31 1996</p>
<p>			   (billion stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		56.7		   vs 50.3</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 34.0		   vs 30.0</p>
<p> Pretax		     2.964		  vs 2.505</p>
<p> Turnover		   8.341		  vs 7.638</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 2.913 and 3.005 billion stg, with a dividend of between 33.0 and 36.4 pence.</p>
<p>Full company name - Glaxo Wellcome Plc</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
